  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/781e90e398d2658730e2f5010fe2072dfeda2671098d4cef3d5f775ac06028a8.png] \n\n**Given equation:**\n\n49 + 7 × 10 ÷ 6 − 3 = 73\n\nLet's check each option by interchanging the signs and applying the BODMAS rule:\n\n**1) Interchanging + and −**\n\nNew equation: 49 **−** 7 × 10 ÷ 6 **+** 3 = ?\n\n= 49 − __**7 × 10**__ ÷ 6 + 3\n\n= 49 − __**70 ÷ 6**__ + 3\n\n= 49 − 11.67 + 3\n\n= __**37.33 + 3**__\n\n= 40.33 ≠ 73 (Incorrect)\n\n**2) Interchanging × and +**\n\nNew equation: 49 **×** 7 **+** 10 ÷ 6 − 3 = ?\n\n= __**49 × 7**__ + 10 ÷ 6 − 3\n\n= 343 + __**10 ÷ 6**__ − 3\n\n= 343 + 1.67 − 3\n\n= __**344.67 − 3**__\n\n= 341.67 ≠ 73 (Incorrect)\n\n**3) Interchanging − and ×**\n\nNew equation: 49 + 7 **−** 10 ÷ 6 **×** 3 = ?\n\n= 49 + 7 − __**10 ÷ 6**__ × 3\n\n= 49 + 7 − 1.67 __**× 3**__\n\n= __**49 + 7**__ − 5.01\n\n= __**56 − 5.01**__\n\n= 50.99 ≠ 73 (Incorrect)\n\n**4) Interchanging + and ÷**\n\nNew equation: 49 **÷** 7 × 10 **+** 6 − 3 = ?\n\n= __**49 ÷ 7**__ × 10 + 6 − 3\n\n= __**7 × 10**__ + 6 − 3\n\n= __**70 + 6**__ − 3 = 73\n\n**73 = 73 (Correct)**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 4\"**.",
